  "comment": "The OTHER PERSON'S response to being asked -- dl_accept / dl_decline. Choosing WHOM to ask (and whether to ask at all vs do it myself) is the unified PURSUIT (bigville_pursuit); this seed is just the asked person's side: accept if capable + willing (relationship + offer clears their bar), else decline. Two parties, two decisions.",
